<Layout title="Shahzad Akram" pageTitle="Franchise & Multi-Location SEO Consultant | Shahzad Akram" description="Franchise and multi-location SEO from Shahzad Akram. Improve local visibility, customer enquiries and franchise recruitment with experienced SEO support.">
<article class="wrapper marketing">
<section class="hero">
<p class="eyebrow">SHAHZAD AKRAM · SEO CONSULTANT</p>
<h1>SEO for franchise and multi-location businesses</h1>
<p>Help more customers find your locations—and more prospective franchisees discover your business.</p>
<p>I’m Shahzad Akram. I bring more than 15 years’ experience in SEO, lead generation and website development, including leading search strategy across World Options, Mail Boxes Etc. UK and PACK &amp; SEND UK.</p>
<p>I help businesses connect national search strategy with local visibility, practical website improvements and measurable enquiries.</p>
<p class="actions"><a href="/contact/">Discuss your project</a> · <a href="/work/">Explore my work</a></p>
</section>
<section>
<h2>Experience across brands, locations and markets</h2>
<p>My experience includes responsibility for:</p>
<ul><li><strong>Six websites</strong> across a multi-brand portfolio.</li><li><strong>Approximately 191 physical store pages</strong>, alongside 335 virtual service office pages.</li><li><strong>Nine major website launches and migrations</strong> across the UK, US and Australia.</li></ul>
<p>That work involves more than optimising pages. It means coordinating head-office priorities, franchisee needs, developers and agencies—and making sure agreed improvements reach the live website.</p>
</section>
<section>
<h2>Search growth across your franchise network</h2>
<h3>Help customers find their local business</h3>
<p>Your national website and local presence should work together. I help improve how customers discover your services, find the right location and make an enquiry.</p>
<p>This includes location pages, Google Business Profiles, service-area content, internal linking and the journey from search to contact.</p>
<p><a href="/services/multi-location-seo/">Explore multi-location SEO</a></p>
<h3>Help prospective franchisees find your opportunity</h3>
<p>Franchise recruitment involves a different audience and a different decision. Prospective owners need to understand the opportunity, investment, support and suitability before they enquire.</p>
<p>I help organise and improve recruitment websites so they answer those questions and support organic discovery.</p>
<p><a href="/franchise-seo/#franchise-recruitment">Explore franchise recruitment SEO</a></p>
</section>
<section>
<h2>How I can help</h2>
<h3>Franchise &amp; Multi-Location SEO</h3>
<p>Build a joined-up search strategy across your brand, locations and service areas. Identify gaps in local visibility and prioritise improvements across the network.</p>
<p><a href="/franchise-seo/">Explore franchise SEO</a></p>
<h3>Franchise Recruitment SEO</h3>
<p>Improve how prospective franchisees find and understand your opportunity, with clearer website structure, useful content and a stronger enquiry journey.</p>
<p><a href="/franchise-seo/#franchise-recruitment">Explore recruitment SEO</a></p>
<h3>Technical SEO &amp; Website Migrations</h3>
<p>Find the technical issues limiting your website, or bring SEO into a rebuild before important decisions are made. Support covers website architecture, migration planning, developer coordination and post-launch checks.</p>
<p><a href="/franchise-seo/#technical-seo">Explore technical SEO</a></p>
<h3>SEO Consultancy &amp; Leadership</h3>
<p>Get experienced support with strategy, priorities and delivery. I work with internal teams and external partners to turn recommendations into clear actions and meaningful reporting.</p>
<p><a href="/franchise-seo/#consultancy">Explore SEO consultancy</a></p>
</section>
<section>
<h2>Selected experience and results</h2>
<h3>World Options: franchise recruitment search growth</h3>
<p>Annual organic sessions on the World Options franchise website increased by <strong>115% between 2023 and 2024</strong>, from 2,792 to 5,996, during my responsibility for SEO.</p>
<p>My wider role covered search strategy, content, website improvements and performance reporting.</p>
<h3>Mail Boxes Etc. UK: organic growth across an established network</h3>
<p>After I took responsibility in March 2025, organic sessions increased by <strong>30% year on year across the first four months</strong>, from 122,923 to 159,968.</p>
<p>The role brings together national website performance, local visibility and the needs of the franchise network.</p>
<h3>Website launches across three markets</h3>
<p>I have led <strong>nine major website launches and migrations across the UK, US and Australia</strong>, covering platform decisions, website structure, analytics, launch planning and coordination with delivery partners.</p>
<p>These examples relate to work undertaken in my employed roles.</p>
<p><a href="/work/">Explore my work</a></p>
</section>
<section>
<h2>Practical experience on both sides of the website</h2>
<p>I’ve spent my career working on websites that need to generate business.</p>
<p>Alongside my employed SEO leadership roles, I built and operated my own Shopify business, Shilajit UK. That meant taking responsibility for the website and marketing, as well as products, fulfilment and customer service.</p>
<p>That commercial experience shapes how I approach SEO. Rankings and traffic matter, but so do the quality of enquiries, the customer journey and whether the business can act on the opportunities being created.</p>
<p><a href="/about/">More about me</a> · <a href="/work/shilajit-uk/">Read the Shilajit UK case study</a></p>
</section>
<section>
<h2>How we would work together</h2>
<h3>1. Understand the business</h3>
<p>We start with your objectives, website, locations and current challenges. We establish what you need help with and who will be involved.</p>
<h3>2. Identify the priorities</h3>
<p>I review the relevant search performance, content, technical setup and enquiry journey, then put the findings into a practical order.</p>
<h3>3. Move the work forward</h3>
<p>Depending on the scope, I can make improvements directly, prepare clear briefs or coordinate delivery with your team, developers and agency.</p>
<h3>4. Measure and refine</h3>
<p>We review the measures that matter to the project—from search visibility and engaged visits to tracked enquiries—and use the findings to guide the next steps.</p>
</section>
<section>
<h2>Notes from the work</h2>
<p>I write about SEO, website development, analytics and the lessons of running my own businesses.</p>
<p>Expect practical explanations, specific examples and an honest account of what worked, what needed fixing and what I learned.</p>
<p><a href="/blog/">Read the blog</a> · <a href="/seo/">Browse SEO guides</a></p>
</section>
<section>
<h2>Let’s discuss your website</h2>
<p>Whether you manage a franchise network, need support with a migration or want an experienced second opinion on your SEO, tell me what you’re working on.</p>
<p>Share your website and the main challenge you want to address. I’ll reply personally so we can establish whether I can help.</p>
<p><a href="/contact/">Discuss your project</a></p>
<p>Or email <a href="mailto:contact@shahzadakram.com">contact@shahzadakram.com</a>.</p>
</section>
</article>
</Layout>
